    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2731" root="بطأ" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَطِىْءٌ</span></b>  <i>Slow, tardy, dilatory, late,</i> or <i>backward;</i> applied to a man, (S, Msb, TA,) and to
a horse or the like: (S, TA:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَطَآءٌ</span>. (S, K,
TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also an imitative sequent to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَطِىْءٌ</span>.
(S in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حطأ</span>.)

